flowchart LR
  IN[FarmUp, SysUp, FCA and Telegram intake] --> CASE[Canonical Portal case]
  CASE --> VISIT[JBL visit and evidence]
  VISIT --> CREDIT[Credit decision]
  CREDIT --> FINAL[Final approval]
  FINAL --> ORDER[Requisition workspace and exact signed workbook]
  ORDER --> HB[HB installation and commissioning]
  ORDER --> INV[Invoice matching and identity verification]
  INV --> PAY[Payment review, workbook and exact signed scan]
  PRODUCT[Governed products and locations] --> CASE
  PRODUCT --> ORIG[Independent Origination application and signing]
  PRODUCT --> TAT[TAT case and credit assessment]
  SPIN[Independent SPIN requests]
  CASE --> REPORT[Reports and milestone recognition]
  HB --> REPORT
